    "the facsimile needs a document that renders (MADDocumentRenderProtocol); --format html-flow is the reflowable one and needs no more.": {
      "comment": "Error when the HTML facsimile export has no renderable document.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Das Faksimile benötigt ein Dokument, das rendert (MADDocumentRenderProtocol); --format html-flow ist das umfließende Format und benötigt nichts weiter."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "el facsímil necesita un documento que se pueda renderizar (MADDocumentRenderProtocol); --format html-flow es el de flujo flexible y no necesita más."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ファクシミリにはレンダリング可能なドキュメントが必要です (MADDocumentRenderProtocol)。--format html-flow はリフロー可能な形式で、それ以上は不要です。"
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "o fac-símile precisa de um documento que possa ser renderizado (MADDocumentRenderProtocol); --format html-flow é o de fluxo reajustável e não precisa de mais nada."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "facsimile 需要可渲染的文档（MADDocumentRenderProtocol）；--format html-flow 是可重排格式，无需更多内容。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "the report's rendered structure needs a document that renders (MADDocumentRenderProtocol); --format json is the data half and needs no more.": {
