    "v%@": {
      "comment": "Localized UI string.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "shouldTranslate": false
    },
    "• PDF Document (.pdf), HTML Page (.html), HTML Flow (.html), CSV Spreadsheet (.csv), JSON Data (.json), JSON Full Report (.json), and Plain Text (.txt).": {
      "comment": "About overview list of export formats. Format names and file extensions are not translated.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "• PDF-Dokument (.pdf), HTML-Seite (.html), HTML-Fließtext (.html), CSV-Tabelle (.csv), JSON-Daten (.json), JSON-Vollbericht (.json) und reiner Text (.txt)."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "• Documento PDF (.pdf), página HTML (.html), HTML fluido (.html), hoja de cálculo CSV (.csv), datos JSON (.json), informe completo JSON (.json) y texto sin formato (.txt)."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "• PDF ドキュメント (.pdf)、HTML ページ (.html)、HTML フロー (.html)、CSV スプレッドシート (.csv)、JSON データ (.json)、JSON フルレポート (.json)、プレーンテキスト (.txt)。"
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "• Documento PDF (.pdf), Página HTML (.html), Fluxo HTML (.html), Planilha CSV (.csv), Dados JSON (.json), Relatório Completo JSON (.json) e Texto Simples (.txt)."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "• PDF 文档（.pdf）、HTML 页面（.html）、HTML 流（.html）、CSV 电子表格（.csv）、JSON 数据（.json）、JSON 完整报表（.json）和纯文本（.txt）。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "• Parametric Bands: Report Header, Page Header, Group Header(s), Report Detail, Group Footer(s), Page Footer, and Report Footer.\n• Elements: Static Labels, Bound Data Fields, Group & Report Aggregates (SUM, COUNT, AVG, MIN, MAX, STDDEV, VARIANCE), Barcodes (powered by zint), Images, and Lines.": {
      "comment": "About overview list of report sections and element types. Keep the SQL aggregate names (SUM, COUNT, …) as they are.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "• Parametrische Bänder: Berichtskopf, Seitenkopf, Gruppenkopf (-köpfe), Berichtsdetail, Gruppenfuß (-füße), Seitenfuß und Berichtsfuß.\n• Elemente: Statische Beschriftungen, gebundene Datenfelder, Gruppen- & Berichtsaggregate (SUM, COUNT, AVG, MIN, MAX, STDDEV, VARIANCE), Barcodes (bereitgestellt von zint), Bilder und Linien."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "• Bandas paramétricas: encabezado del informe, encabezado de página, encabezados de grupo, detalle del informe, pies de grupo, pie de página y pie del informe.\n• Elementos: etiquetas estáticas, campos de datos vinculados, agregados de grupo e informe (SUM, COUNT, AVG, MIN, MAX, STDDEV, VARIANCE), códigos de barras (con tecnología de zint), imágenes y líneas."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "• パラメトリックバンド: レポートヘッダー、ページヘッダー、グループヘッダー、レポート詳細、グループフッター、ページフッター、レポートフッター。\n• 要素: 静的ラベル、バインドされたデータフィールド、グループとレポートの集計 (SUM, COUNT, AVG, MIN, MAX, STDDEV, VARIANCE)、バーコード（zint による）、画像、線。"
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "• Faixas Paramétricas: Cabeçalho do Relatório, Cabeçalho da Página, Cabeçalho(s) do Grupo, Detalhe do Relatório, Rodapé(s) do Grupo, Rodapé da Página e Rodapé do Relatório.\n• Elementos: Rótulos Estáticos, Campos de Dados Vinculados, Agregados de Grupo & Relatório (SUM, COUNT, AVG, MIN, MAX, STDDEV, VARIANCE), Códigos de Barras (desenvolvidos por zint), Imagens e Linhas."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "• 参数化带区：报表页眉、页眉、组页眉、报表明细、组页脚、页脚和报表页脚。\n• 元素：静态标签、绑定的数据字段、组与报表聚合（SUM、COUNT、AVG、MIN、MAX、STDDEV、VARIANCE）、条码（由 zint 提供支持）、图像和线条。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "• SQLite 3 (local .sqlite3 / .db files and embedded row caching)\n• MySQL & MariaDB (via MariaDB Connector/C over TLS)\n• Microsoft SQL Server (via FreeTDS over TDS / TLS)\n• PostgreSQL (via PostgreSQL libpq)": {
      "comment": "About overview list of database drivers. Product and library names are brands; do not translate them.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "• SQLite 3 (lokale .sqlite3 / .db-Dateien und eingebettetes Zeilen-Caching)\n• MySQL & MariaDB (über MariaDB Connector/C via TLS)\n• Microsoft SQL Server (über FreeTDS via TDS / TLS)\n• PostgreSQL (über PostgreSQL libpq)"
          }
        },
        "es": {
